ght tracking-[-2.4px] text-pretty text-landing-text-primary lg:text-[42px]">Hundreds of millions in prediction market positions sit idle every day waiting to be resolved</h2><p class="font-sans text-[17px] font-normal text-muted lg:text-[22px]">You go to Polymarket and buy <span class="text-brand-green">YES </span>on your thesis but resolution is in nine months. That&#x27;s dead capital.</p></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto mt-10 mix-blend-multiply transition-all delay-150 duration-700 ease-out translate-y-5 opacity-0 h-[800px] md:h-auto"><div class="relative"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="957" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[600px] w-full object-cover lg:h-auto" style="color:transparent;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 50%, transparent 95%)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhalftone-dots.2xevugr_59z2x.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhalftone-dots.2xevugr_59z2x.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhalftone-dots.2xevugr_59z2x.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="hidden md:block"><div class="absolute drop-shadow-md" style="top:20%;left:20%;transform:rotate(-2.75deg)"><div class="relative h-80 w-80"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="718" height="681" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fpaper-card.2duqzo_qf4gcj.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fpaper-card.2duqzo_qf4gcj.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fpaper-card.2duqzo_qf4gcj.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/><div class="relative flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="size-7 text-landing-pink" aria-hidden="true"><g fil