ath></g></svg><span class="font-heading text-[14px] font-normal text-primary lg:text-[16px]">HOW IT WORKS</span></div><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5"><h2 class="font-heading text-[34px] leading-none font-light tracking-[-1.7px] text-landing-text-primary lg:text-[48px] lg:tracking-[-2.4px]">3 steps to start earning</h2><p class="font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.5] font-normal tracking-[-0.17px] text-muted lg:text-[20px] lg:tracking-[-0.2px]">From trade to yield in under a minute. No bridging, no transfers. Just deposit and start earning.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-8 md:px-16"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-dashed border-landing-border"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col items-stretch lg:flex-row 2xl:container"><div class="contents"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-center pt-12 transition-all duration-700 ease-out lg:pt-10 translate-y-6 opacity-0" style="transition-delay:300ms"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-border bg-white drop-shadow-md"><span class="font-heading text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-normal tracking-[-0.8px] text-muted">1</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5"><h3 class="px-1 font-heading text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-normal tracking-[-1.12px] text-landing-text-primary lg:text-[30px] lg:tracking-[-1.2px]">Trade</h3><p class="max-w-xs px-1 font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.5] font-normal tracking-[-0.17px] text-muted lg:text-[18px] lg:tracking-[-0.18px]">Buy YES or NO tokens on Polymarket. Take any position on any market</p></div></div><img alt="Step 1: Trade" loading="lazy" width="1856" height="2256" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mt-auto block h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhiw-step-trade.2t_jevzd5i4g0.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhiw-step-trade.2